    "description": "Flash port of the physical slot machine game, Wolf Run\n\n•\tFirst game assigned to me from IGT, and I was trusted with porting one of the most beloved and most profitable franchises of the company. \n\n•\tFinished production sooner than expected with very little supervision.\n",
